scratch
.qoder

# Offline OCR language data — 7 MB the build must never carry.
# Shipping them was tried and measured on 2026-10-01: served fine (200, 2.5 MB and 5.2 MB)
# and changed nothing, because the engine that reads them does not finish inside a request
# on this platform whether the tables are near it or not. They stay out until that witness
# gets a home where it can complete.
*.traineddata
